$ A 2 x 5 CQUAD4 strip clamped at grids 1 and 101, with ASET1 345 on the free grids 2-6 and 102-106: their T1, T2
$ and R3 (drilling) are omitted, and AUTOSPC then holds the drilling DOFs. Static condensation is exact, so
$ the displacements must equal those of the same strip without the ASET1 (the expected values in cases_new.txt).
SOL 101
CEND
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
BEGIN BULK
GRID    1               0.0     0.      0.
GRID    101             0.0     1.      0.
GRID    2               1.0     0.      0.
GRID    102             1.0     1.      0.
GRID    3               2.0     0.      0.
GRID    103             2.0     1.      0.
GRID    4               3.0     0.      0.
GRID    104             3.0     1.      0.
GRID    5               4.0     0.      0.
GRID    105             4.0     1.      0.
GRID    6               5.0     0.      0.
GRID    106             5.0     1.      0.
CQUAD4  1       1       1       2       102     101     
CQUAD4  2       1       2       3       103     102     
CQUAD4  3       1       3       4       104     103     
CQUAD4  4       1       4       5       105     104     
CQUAD4  5       1       5       6       106     105     
PSHELL  1       1       0.05    1               1
MAT1    1       7.E10           0.3     2700.
SPC1    1       123456  1       101
FORCE   1       6       0       100.    0.      0.      1.
FORCE   1       106     0       100.    0.      0.      1.
FORCE   1       4       0       50.     1.      0.      0.
ASET1   345     2       THRU    6
ASET1   345     102     THRU    106
ENDDATA
